<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page qd-theme qd-profile"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">MEMBERSHIP & HEALTH OPERATIONS</view><view class="heading">把照顾自己的服务，配置好。</view><view class="notice section">新人赠卡只在首次模拟注册时发放；修改配置不改变已经发放的权益快照。</view><view wx:if="{{role !== 'hq'}}" class="notice warn mt">当前仅可查看；请在工作台切换为总部管理员进行维护。</view><view class="card section"><view class="grid2"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">新人卡天数</text><input class="input" type="number" data-key="trialDays" value="{{form.trialDays}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">新人每日额度</text><input class="input" type="number" data-key="trialDaily" value="{{form.trialDaily}}" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">预算接近提醒阈值 / %</text><input class="input" type="number" data-key="budgetWarning" value="{{form.budgetWarning}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view wx:for="{{adviceFields}}" wx:key="key" class="form-field"><text class="form-label">{{item.label}}</text><textarea data-key="{{item.key}}" value="{{form[item.key]}}" maxlength="300" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="btn" disabled="{{role !== 'hq' || busy}}" bindtap="save">保存配置</button></view><view class="card section"><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/catalog/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>统一会员套餐池 ›</text></button><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/ads-config/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>广告赠次与广告位 ›</text></button><button class="menu-item" data-url="/pages/ai-config/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/sun.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>AI服务与全局额度 ›</text></button></view></block><view class="card section"><view class="section-title mb">平台展示与期限</view><view class="switch-row"><view class="grow"><text>公开榜昵称脱敏</text></view><switch checked="{{platform.nicknameMask}}" data-key="nicknameMask" bindchange="platformInput"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">月榜领取宽限 / 天</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{platform.claimGrace}}" data-key="claimGrace" bindinput="platformInput"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">到期提前提醒 / 天</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{platform.expiryDays}}" data-key="expiryDays" bindinput="platformInput"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">客服 HTTPS 链接</text><input class="input" value="{{platform.serviceUrl}}" data-key="serviceUrl" bindinput="platformInput"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">首页公告</text><textarea maxlength="300" value="{{platform.announcement}}" data-key="announcement" bindinput="platformInput"/></view><button class="btn" bindtap="savePlatform" disabled="{{busy || (role!=='hq' && role!=='admin')}}">保存平台设置</button></view><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
